1
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,079
Yaoyao

2
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:06,840
Sun Ming

3
00:01:10,359 --> 00:01:11,200
Sun Ming

4
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,040
Sorry to bother you.

5
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,719
Ms. Gu Ting.

6
00:01:18,719 --> 00:01:19,599
My condolences.

7
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:21,959
The police need your cooperation for a statement

8
00:01:21,959 --> 00:01:23,239
to help us understand the situation.

9
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,519
I understand you now.

10
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,840
She and Yaoyao

11
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:37,120
are exactly alike.

12
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,439
But

13
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:41,159
I know what to do.

14
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:02,120
Take this.

15
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,519
It can save your life when it counts.

16
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:16,039
We pulled surveillance footage from multiple areas.

17
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,520
After comparing them,

18
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,680
we finally confirmed

19
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:21,240
that the one who initially kidnapped Gu Ting

20
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,120
was Grass Snake.

21
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,159
But Gu Ting explicitly stated

22
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:25,840
that the masked suspect

23
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,680
was not Grass Snake.

24
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,159
So,

25
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,439
Grass Snake was silenced.

26
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,319
I suspect

27
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,520
Yan Li squeezed the last drop of value from Grass Snake,

28
00:02:37,879 --> 00:02:38,759
then discarded him.

29
00:02:39,759 --> 00:02:40,639
What about evidence at the scene?

30
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:42,080
Completely clean.

31
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:45,639
The suspect left no biological traces.

32
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:50,120
With Grass Snake dead,

33
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:51,560
his successor

34
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,439
is highly likely to be Bro Liu.

35
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,680
I will go find Bro Liu.

36
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,479
No, you cannot.

37
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,639
Bro Liu is cunning and paranoid.

38
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,960
He will definitely suspect you.

39
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,319
It is too dangerous.

40
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,120
You need to find a way to lure him out,

41
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,680
and let us arrest him.

42
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,560
No.

43
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,439
Their methods are too unpredictable.

44
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,680
It is easy to tip off the enemy.

45
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,280
Most importantly,

46
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:14,120
he is the only way to find evidence of Yan Li's crimes.

47
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:17,360
Bro Liu probably does not even know

48
00:03:18,759 --> 00:03:20,159
where Yan Li's real hideout is.

49
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:32,520
How does it feel sitting in Grass Snake's seat?

50
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:34,520
Sir.

51
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,159
We all work for you.

52
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:38,080
We always look out for you, Sir.

53
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,719
I told you to get a few guys to keep watch.

54
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:41,280
Why did you run off by yourself?

55
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:42,039
No, no.

56
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:43,319
Sir.

57
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:45,639
I just figured I'd patrol a bit further out that day.

58
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,879
I didn't expect that right after I left,

59
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:48,039
the police would show up.

60
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,000
Really.

61
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:49,919
It's true.

62
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,560
I will believe you for now.

63
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:54,360
As long as you stay loyal to me,

64
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:55,560
I will not treat you badly.

65
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:58,039
Yes, I will be absolutely loyal.

66
00:03:58,919 --> 00:03:59,919
Remember this.

67
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,560
No matter what it is,

68
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:03,560
you can only take what I give you.

69
00:04:04,199 --> 00:04:05,280
Do not try to be clever.

70
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:06,639
Otherwise,

71
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,800
I will send you

72
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,719
to partner up with Grass Snake.

73
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,680
Understood.

74
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,319
Also,

75
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,479
starting today,

76
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,160
you are in charge of this company.

77
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,920
The monthly quota

78
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,240
is at least five million.

79
00:04:20,279 --> 00:04:21,279
My commission

80
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:23,319
needs to be

81
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,839
ten percent higher than before.

82
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,439
Any objections?

83
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:27,279
No objections.

84
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,360
Thank you, Sir.

85
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,759
Good.

86
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:39,959
Five million?

87
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,920
With the cops watching so closely,

88
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,680
how am I supposed to hit five million?

89
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,480
That's a pipe dream.

90
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:53,680
Hello?

91
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:54,839
Brother Liu!

92
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:57,120
I finally got out of that detention center.

93
00:04:57,759 --> 00:04:58,839
I heard you got promoted.

94
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:01,120
Can I come work for you?

95
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:03,920
What's wrong, Brother Liu?

96
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:04,920
Is it a bad time?

97
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:07,519
No, it's a great time.

98
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:08,759
I'll send someone to pick you up.

99
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,360
Great, Brother Liu.

100
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:11,480
I'll be waiting.

101
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:56,800
Brother Liu!

102
00:05:57,319 --> 00:05:58,279
What's going on here?

103
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,040
Opening a new company,

104
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,519
making it boom.

105
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:05,959
It's also to avoid suspicion.

106
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,759
Nothing good ever happens when I run into you.

107
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:08,959
You really had the nerve to show up.

108
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:09,720
Brother Liu.

109
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,439
I spent seven whole days in the detention center.

110
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:14,199
How can I make it right?

111
00:06:14,399 --> 00:06:15,399
You don't even believe me.

112
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,199
How are you gonna make it right?

113
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,759
I met an older guy inside for drunk driving this time.

114
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,079
He's got deep pockets.

115
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:22,160
He's very confident in himself.

116
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:24,519
Has millions ready to invest.

117
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,120
Seriously?

118
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,399
Of course it's true.

119
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:29,680
Brother Liu,

120
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:31,319
you just took over.

121
00:06:31,959 --> 00:06:33,360
You definitely need results, right?

122
00:06:34,279 --> 00:06:35,279
Let your little bro help you out.

123
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,800
Brother Liu, don't hesitate.

124
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,279
There are already plenty of financial managers

125
00:06:41,279 --> 00:06:41,879
targeting this guy,

126
00:06:41,879 --> 00:06:42,560
getting ready to scam him.

127
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,000
We gotta hurry.

128
00:06:48,879 --> 00:06:49,519
Little bro,

129
00:06:49,879 --> 00:06:51,079
it's not that I don't believe you.

130
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,959
Someone complained to me that you're no good.

131
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,920
Don't be offended.

132
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,560
Brother Liu,

133
00:06:59,639 --> 00:07:00,720
I'm actually

134
00:07:01,279 --> 00:07:02,399
not offended at all.

135
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:03,000
It's nothing.

136
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:04,879
It's just that if this deal works out,

137
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,360
about my cut...

138
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,040
bump it up a bit.

139
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,160
No sweat.

140
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,600
As long as it goes through,

141
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,920
you'll get your fair share.

142
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:14,160
Thank you, Brother Liu.

143
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,920
Brains and brawn

144
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,199
fits Brother Liu's vibe perfectly.

145
00:07:21,519 --> 00:07:22,560
Good eye.

146
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,600
Dye your hair,

147
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:24,920
and I'll make you a master.

148
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:25,959
Really?

149
00:07:25,959 --> 00:07:27,759
I've always wanted to dye my hair blond.

150
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,000
Know a bit about fashion.

151
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,279
Hello.

152
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,480
Send me a personnel list for your new company

153
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:45,199
and their contact info.

154
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,160
The more detailed, the better.

155
00:07:47,879 --> 00:07:48,959
Okay, okay.

156
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,920
Brother Liu,

157
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,720
we gave that guy a little taste a few days ago,

158
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:00,920
and he took the bait.

159
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,720
Says he wants to meet the Financial Master now.

160
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,759
What should we do?

161
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:04,519
Call him!

162
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,360
Hurry up.

163
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:06,600
What if someone else scams him first?

164
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:07,920
Hurry!

165
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:08,600
Oh, got it.

166
00:08:19,199 --> 00:08:19,959
Hello?

167
00:08:19,959 --> 00:08:20,800
Boss Gu.

168
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,279
Master Liu is sitting right next to me.

169
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:25,199
Ask him whatever you want to know.

170
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,519
Hello, Grandmaster Liu.

171
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,199
I wouldn't call myself a grandmaster.

172
00:08:30,199 --> 00:08:31,480
Just call me Master Liu.

173
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,320
Hello, Master Liu.

174
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:35,200
Master Liu,

175
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,360
Boss Gu here is a beginner.

176
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,200
He wants to invest,

177
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,000
but doesn't have the channels.

178
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,799
So he wanted to ask for your advice.

179
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,399
Investing as a beginner

180
00:08:44,639 --> 00:08:45,759
carries a lot of risk.

181
00:08:45,759 --> 00:08:47,200
I suggest you wait and see.

182
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:47,759
Come on.

183
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,480
Master Liu,

184
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:49,799
Boss Gu is really sincere.

185
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,200
Do it for my sake,

186
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:51,960
and help him out.

187
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,559
Yeah, yeah.

188
00:08:55,279 --> 00:08:56,000
So,

189
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,000
what kind of investment is Boss Gu looking for?

190
00:08:58,519 --> 00:08:59,799
I heard from Little Li

191
00:09:00,279 --> 00:09:02,399
that your wealth management returns are quite stable.

192
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,519
I want to give it a try.

193
00:09:03,799 --> 00:09:05,480
It's like this, Boss Gu.

194
00:09:05,559 --> 00:09:06,919
Our investment projects

195
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:09,279
are only open to our VIPs.

196
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,879
Then how can I become a VIP member?

197
00:09:11,879 --> 00:09:14,519
Boss Gu, our VIP screening process

198
00:09:14,519 --> 00:09:16,000
is extremely strict.

199
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,279
That's no problem.

200
00:09:17,759 --> 00:09:18,600
Can I apply?

201
00:09:19,799 --> 00:09:21,559
Come on, Grandmaster Liu.

202
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,480
Boss Gu is my friend.

203
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:24,799
If it comes down to it,

204
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,320
I'll vouch for him.

205
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:29,559
All right.

206
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:31,480
For Little Li's sake,

207
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,799
I'll make an exception for you.

208
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,960
Boss Gu can become our VIP.

209
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,519
But we have to sign a contract,

210
00:09:36,919 --> 00:09:39,559
so Boss Gu doesn't skip out on our cut once he makes a profit.

211
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,360
Right?

212
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,120
That won't happen.

213
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,960
I won't back out on what I owe.

214
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,159
Don't worry.

215
00:09:44,559 --> 00:09:45,200
Wait a moment.

216
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,559
Boss Gu is so straightforward!

217
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:56,120
How much is Boss Gu preparing to invest?

218
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:57,679
As for me,

219
00:09:57,679 --> 00:09:58,759
I'm very cautious with investments.

220
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:01,399
I'll start with two million to test the waters.

221
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:02,279
Is that okay?

222
00:10:03,639 --> 00:10:05,960
Two million?

223
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,200
Two million...

224
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,360
I've never even seen that much money.

225
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,399
No problem.

226
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:13,480
Your two million

227
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,679
will go into our Sure Win Plan.

228
00:10:15,759 --> 00:10:16,679
I can guarantee

229
00:10:16,679 --> 00:10:19,200
your return will be over 30 percent.

230
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,679
30 percent?

231
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:22,960
That sounds great!

232
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:24,559
How about this?

233
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,799
Why don't we have morning tea together

234
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,360
and sign the contract in person?

235
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,799
Master Liu, does that work for you?

236
00:10:30,679 --> 00:10:31,840
What do we do about this?

237
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:34,480
What do we do?

238
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:39,600
No problem.

239
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,120
Send me an address,

240
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:42,679
and I'll see you there.

241
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,360
Sure thing, no problem.

242
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,399
Wait for my message.

243
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,960
Two million...

244
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,759
We're rich!

245
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:52,639
Brother Liu,

246
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:55,159
you need to dye your hair back.

247
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,240
Why?

248
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,559
It's burgundy right now,

249
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:58,519
not true red.

250
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:01,519
We're about to be loaded!

251
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:03,759
Loaded!

252
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,559
Loaded indeed.

253
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,240
Change it back.

254
00:11:10,159 --> 00:11:10,919
Little brother,

255
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:12,200
it's not that I don't trust you.

256
00:11:12,399 --> 00:11:14,360
You have too much of a track record.

257
00:11:15,159 --> 00:11:16,159
Stay right here.

258
00:11:16,399 --> 00:11:17,399
Wait for my triumphant return.

259
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:21,559
Let's go.

260
00:11:21,559 --> 00:11:22,360
Let's go dye my hair.

261
00:11:32,159 --> 00:11:32,799
Seven, eight, nine.

262
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:35,000
You guys go find somewhere to hang out for a bit.

263
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:35,799
I have some business to attend to.

264
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,240
Damn, Sun Ming.
